# The SOURCE of `requirements-notebooks.txt`, which is a compiled lockfile: edit this
# file and recompile as `requirements.in`'s header says (§10 Phase 14).
#
# The analysis notebooks (§10 Phase 14): `notebooks/13_1_analysis.ipynb` (S3)
# and `notebooks/13_3_validation.ipynb` (S1). The research machine and CI
# install this; Render never does.
#
# nbclient runs a notebook headless — `jupyter execute --inplace
# notebooks/13_3_validation.ipynb` — and is how the suite runs both; ipykernel
# is the kernel it starts. pandas serves the notebooks' "Exploring" cells only:
# every regenerated table is computed by the harnesses' own code. To browse the
# notebooks interactively, add JupyterLab (`pip install jupyterlab`).

-r requirements-research.in

